FIRST_TEST_DRY_RUN: no DDS, no publisher, no motor commands.
--protected-handoff requires confirmed lidar geometry and an attended TTY.
Read-only: --first-test-preflight / --check-lowcmd / --robot-print / --lowcmd-monitor-seconds.
